### MongoDB Atlas Vector Search Index Definition
Create a vector search index named `vector_index` on the `dunki_knowledge_chunks` collection:
```json
{
  "fields": [
    {
      "type": "vector",
      "path": "embedding",
      "numDimensions": 1536,
      "similarity": "cosine"
    },
    {
      "type": "filter",
      "path": "domain"
    },
    {
      "type": "filter",
      "path": "metadata.roles"
    }
  ]
}
```

### MongoDB Vector Search Aggregation Pipeline
```javascript
const results = await db.collection("dunki_knowledge_chunks").aggregate([
  {
    $vectorSearch: {
      index: "vector_index",
      path: "embedding",
      queryVector: queryEmbedding,
      numCandidates: 100,
      limit: 3,
      filter: {
        domain: { $in: ["contracts", "payments", "regulations", "general"] }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    $project: {
      _id: 0,
      chunk_id: 1,
      title: 1,
      text: 1,
      score: { $meta: "vectorSearchScore" }
    }
  }
]).toArray();
```

